# Large gen16 artefacts are excluded by design and their SHA-256 is recorded in
# results/MANIFEST.sha256 (START_HERE.md section 8).  Regenerate them with the script named in
# the owning lead's report; verify with scripts/g16_manifest.py --check.
# Everything a report cites by number lives in a small committed CSV or JSON.
results/**/_*.pkl
results/**/_*.parquet
results/**/_pe_keep/
results/L4/per_extractant_by_budget.parquet
results/L3/l3c_per_task.csv
results/**/*.log
!results/**/run.log
__pycache__/
